rows.en:
"Agh!"
Suddenly, I was struck from behind.
By someone... with something very heavy.{p}

So you're not one for piles of print, huh?
Same here.
Still, our library's got a reputation for being something else.{p}

When I got to the library, Shindo was standing there.
"I knew you'd come."
...He stayed away on purpose!{p}

I tried hugging the book to my chest.
...A sad melody rose up in my head.
And I began to sing, the words flowing out effortlessly.{p}

Even the high notes came out naturally, and it felt good.
I was amazed.
This book really...{p}

The people at the desk all stood up at once.
...They're not falling asleep?
What on earth...{p}

Over and over again.
"S-stop it, please☆"
Without thinking, I rushed over to them.{p}
